## Chrome Web Store dashboard

The Chrome Web Store API only uploads and publishes; it can't edit the listing. Copy these fields
into the developer dashboard by hand.

### Store listing → Summary

From the manifest (`_locales/*/messages.json`, `extDescription`), so it ships with the package;
the dashboard shows it read-only. Limit: 132 characters.

{{summary}}

### Store listing → Description (Russian, primary language)

From `store/description.txt`. Pick **Russian** in the dashboard's language menu first.
Limit: 16,000 characters.

{{description}}

### Store listing → Description (English)

From `store/description.en.txt`. Switch the dashboard's language menu to **English**. Limit: 16,000
characters.

{{description_en}}

### Privacy practices → Single purpose

```text
Replaces text the user selects and sends to it from the right-click menu with a German version at the user's level, with vocabulary glosses and exercises built from that text.
```

### Privacy practices → Permission justification

Every permission and host the release manifest requests, with its justification from `store/`.

{{permissions}}

### Privacy practices → Remote code

**No, I am not using remote code.** All JavaScript is in the package; the server returns JSON only.

### Privacy practices → Data usage

| Data type | Collected? | What and why |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Personally identifiable information | No | |
| Health information | No | |
| Financial and payment information | No | |
| Authentication information | No | |
| Personal communications | No | |
| Location | **Yes** | IP address only: Vercel's request logs record it, as the privacy policy says. The app doesn't store it and asks for no other location data. |
| Web history | No | No URLs, titles or visit times. |
| User activity | **Yes** | Usage events tied to a random install ID: paragraph translated (cache hit/miss, latency), exercise completed, error codes. Only for usage metrics. |
| Website content | **Yes** | The text the user selects and sends with "Translate to German" (at most 1,500 characters at a time), sent to our server and Google Gemini to translate it; on an explicit "Bad translation" ("Плохой перевод") click, that text and its translation for quality review. |

Certify all three:

- [ ] I do not sell or transfer user data to third parties, outside of the approved use cases.
- [ ] I do not use or transfer user data for purposes that are unrelated to my item's single purpose.
- [ ] I do not use or transfer user data to determine creditworthiness or for lending purposes.

